window.products.push({"id":473122,"name":"Raccoon and Flowers Soft Throw Blanket All Season Microplush Warm Blankets Lightweight Tufted Fuzzy Flannel Fleece Throws Blanket for Bed Sofa Couch 5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n6R5H3QWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Flannel Fleece Blanket Provides A Cozy, Smooth And Skin-Friendly Surrounding For High Quality Rest In A Natural Sleeping Position And Access To Deep Sleep Quickly. Easy Care: Machine Washable In Cold Water With Similar Colors. On Tumble Dry Low, No Bleach.Multi-Colors Choose: This Ultra-Soft Throw Blanket Is Available In A Variety Of Color Options. Material: 100% Anti-Pilling Flannel Size: 40\" X 50\" Small Suitable For Kids/ 50\" X 60\" Medium Suitable For Teens/ 60\" X 80\" Large Suitable For Adults Package Include: 1 Plush Throw Blanket Multi-Occasion Using Keep Blanket On Your Bed Or Couch For Extra Coziness, Or In Your Car For Perfectly Portable. Great Gift It Makes A Great Gift For Your Friends And Family, Even Pets Love It! This Abstract Decorative Blanket Is Made Of High Quality Microfiber. It'S Very Soft And Comfortable, Like A Solid Hug, So You Can Lie Down, Eliminate Fatigue, And Keep You Comfortable And Warm All Day. This Blanket Print Adds Style To Your Room. Blanket For Any Occasion, Perfect For Cuddling Up While Watching Tv On The Sofa Or Relaxing In Bed. Suitable For Indoor Use, But Also Very Suitable For Outdoor Use; There Is Enough Space For Napping, Sleeping Or Resting. This Blanket Is A Great Gift With Its Own Unique Design. Whether It Is For Your Friends Or Family, They Will Love It !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n6R5H3QWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FREEHOTU","source_asin":"B09G6WMDKZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G6WMDKZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G6WMDKZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":473123,"name":"Mount St. Helen's Washington Eruption Giclee Art Print Poster from Travel Artwork by Artist Paul A. Lanquist 12\" x 18\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lGt3KglOL._AC_SL1234_.jpg","description":"This work of art was designed by Artist Paul A. Lanquist (PAL), a Pacific Northwest artist who currently lives in central Oregon. Through the years, PAL has gravitated to the work of illustrators from the 20's, 30's, and 40's that use color and design to communicate their ideas in a straightforward way. By combining the nostalgic look and feel of the past with the spectacular scenery of this country, PAL has created destination and travel posters that capture the beauty and life style of these unique areas. Art print posters are from an original work of art created by an award-winning artist. They are professionally printed at our facilities in the United States on the highest quality art paper using premium, long-lasting art inks that generate intense, rich colors that are true to the artist’s vision and original creation. The time and care put into producing your art poster will make it a tremendous addition of your kitchen, bedroom, family room, office, or even dorm room wall décor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lGt3KglOL._AC_SL1234_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art of Place","source_asin":"B0713VSGXZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0713VSGXZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0713VSGXZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
