window.products.push({"id":473225,"name":"Butterfly Metal Wall Decor - 3D Design - Hand-Painted - 16” x 12” - Modern Home Decoration - Indoor or Outdoor Use – Wall Art in Beautiful Purple Tone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711Qtillz3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Perfect Household Butterfly Wall Decor Provide an inspirational touch to your homestead with the Creative Critters Butterfly Wall Decor. Handmade to the Highest Standards Unlike cheap and fragile mass-produced signs, this Butterfly wall decor is handmade from durable metal to exacting standards. It’s welded with close attention to detail to ensure a durable piece that will last many years. The hand-painted finish gives it a warm and colorful appearance, and the lacquer finish and protective coat on the back provide added protection. So you can be sure your attractive contemporary-style butterfly wall decor will last you a very long time. Use It Anywhere Hang up your piece indoors or in covered outdoor areas. It measures 16” x 12”, making it just the right size—large enough to get noticed without taking up too much space. Ready to Hang You can hang your Metal Butterfly wherever you want to. It comes with a wall screw and plug so you don’t need to buy anything else. Simply fix the screw to a wall or drill a hole and hang it up in seconds. Decorative Gift Idea The sign is the perfect gift for housewarming parties, birthdays, Christmas, wedding presents, and more. Or get it as a gift to yourself. Create the Perfect Decoration in Your Home—Order Your 3D Butterfly Today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711Qtillz3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Creative Critters","source_asin":"B07GRPXWQR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GRPXWQR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GRPXWQR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
