window.products.push({"id":473344,"name":"Evolution by Waterford Cosmic Waters Paperweight","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LZ+4MemxL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Evolution by Waterford captures the artistry of molten crystal with striking accents of vivid color. Two thrashing oceans, fren in crystal, collide within the smooth sphere of this Cosmic Waters Paperweight. A stunning and dramatic addition to any desk or office, the contrasting blue and yellow accents make this paperweight a guaranteed conversation starter. Hand wash pieces separately in warm, soapy water. Rinse in clean, warm water; dry immediately with lint-free cloth. Remove any lime scale with vinegar and a clean cloth. To clean decanter and vase interiors, half-fill with warm water, 2 tablespoons of white vinegar or ammonia and 1/4 cup of uncooked rice. Swirl to remove residue, then rinse and dry. Amazon.com A meditative work of art, this creatively designed paperweight sets a calming mood in a contemporary home or office setting. Turquoise blue and chartreuse green swirls tempered by transparent bubbles are encased inside a heavy, solid glass globe. Like waves frozen in time, the mesmerizing swirls draw the eye again and again. Mouth-blown by skilled glassworkers in Poland, each brilliantly clear paperweight exhibits unique properties and stands approximately 2-1/2 inches high. Waterford makes the same piece in pink and amber, called the Cosmic Fire paperweight. Evolution, inspired by the forms and colors of nature, is Waterford's most avante garde collection. Encompassing vases, bowls, candle votives, and more, the art glass collection bursts with sophisticated color combinations, asymmetrical shapes, and a lively aesthetic. Packaged in a handsome Waterford logo box, each Evolution piece makes a superb special occasion or corporate gift. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LZ+4MemxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterford Evolution","source_asin":"B000EUJKM0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EUJKM0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EUJKM0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
