window.products.push({"id":473361,"name":"bealy Steamer Basket, Vegetable Steamer Basket Steaming Basket Folding Food Steamer Insert Premium Stainless Steel Veggie Steamer Baskets for Cooking ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r1cNEXr5L._AC_SL1462_.jpg","description":"UPGRADE HANDLE DESIGN/EASY TO USE – bealy upgrade veggie steamer basket has a solid telescoping stainless steel T handle (height-3.2'' to 6.6''), depending on how much you extrend it. The telescoping T handle helps you insert the steamer basket to deep pots and keeps your hands away from hot steam. When you steam big bulky food, you can rotate removing the central handle, after cooking, just screw in the handle to easily take out the vegetable steamer basket. SIZE FIT ANY POT & EASY TO CLEAN – bealy Medium size stainless steel steamer basket collapsed diameter is 6.4 inches, can expand to 10 inches once petals are stretched out. It's not big or small, almost fit various pot/pan size or pressure cooker. It opens like a water lily and it folds compactly to save a lot of storage space. It is easier to clean and storage than large thin mesh steamer. Dishwasher safe. DURABLE & SAFETY – bealy stainless steel steamer basket is made of food-grade stainless steel, handle of steamer basket won't break different from plastic aging to break at high temperatures. Compared with short handle or handleless steamer basket, our steamer's firm telescoping handle can help you to remove easily from hot pot without tilted and no tools needed. Feet of the steam basket have silicone cover that keep them from scratching the bottoms of pots. MULTIFUNCTION & GIFT – bealy steamer basket not only can be used as a food steamer basket, such as steaming broccoli, carrots, corn, cauliflower, potatoes, eggs, meat, crab, seafood, baby food, etc., but also can be used as a strainer or fruit container. You can also use it to filter extra water when making salad. It comes in a perfect size box makes it an awesome GIFT for your family & friends. HEALTHIER COOKING CHOICE – bealy food steamer basket with premium food grade stainless steel design. Steaming is a healthy cooking choice because it helps retain more than 90% of the nutrients lost when boiling. If you don't satisfied with this product, just return it and we'll refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r1cNEXr5L._AC_SL1462_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bealy","source_asin":"B07YW8RV5M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YW8RV5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YW8RV5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
