window.products.push({"id":473443,"name":"Butter Dish with Lid for Countertop, Large Butter Keeper with Knife Butter Holder Suitable for Home/Restaurant Butter Container and Butter Tray (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51atEizmgyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy Scooping: Curved ramps on the inside edge of the butter tray handle make it easy to scoop butter; just slide the knife up the ramp; no more chasing cold butter cubes around the tray; the top of the ramp acts as a scraper to clean your knives and collect butter. Optimized Design: Brackets for butter knives on the side of the lid for better placement of butter knives (including butter knives). The butter tray design with side handles makes it easier to pick up and place, and the top cover makes it easy to pick up the entire cover. Completely Closed for Fresh: This butter pan keeps your butter fresh without mixing with other food flavors, and the butter pan lid fits perfectly into it, fitting and closing correctly every time. Quality and Safety: Our Butter Pan with Lid is Food Safe, Dishwasher Safe, and Microwaveable Butter Pan Tray; Made of food grade melamine imitation ceramic, this butter pan is tough, durable and easy to clean. Ample Capacity: Butter Holder Built-in butter size 5.2*3.5*2.7 inches, fits a full \"US size\" butter stick. Designed for all butters, including East/West Coast butters. Butter lovers, covering your butter with our uniquely designed butter pan means you never have to worry about this classic cookware going out of style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51atEizmgyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SXHEYUY","source_asin":"B097JKNZGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097JKNZGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097JKNZGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":473444,"name":"Crane USA Warm Mist Humidifier, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WRViceI1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description Warm Mist Humidifier Amazon.com The FDA-registered Crane Warm Mist Humidifier's fine, warm mist provides relief from sinus irritation, nasal congestion, dry cough, and cold and flu symptoms. Its two steam output settings create up to 3.6 gallons of moisture per day. The Warm Mist Humidifier requires no filters and provides bacteria-free moisture. For therapeutic relief, it comes with a medicine cup for steam medication. Crane Warm Mist Humidifer, White (1 Gallon)At a Glance: Turns cold tap water into a soothing warm mist Turns cold tap water into a soothing warm mist Relieves cold symptoms, dry skin, and chapped lips Relieves cold symptoms, dry skin, and chapped lips Runs for up to 8 hours Runs for up to 8 hours Releases up to 3.6 gallons of moisture per day Releases up to 3.6 gallons of moisture per day Does not require filter. Does not require filter. Produces bacteria free mist Produces bacteria free mist Compact, easy-to-use humidifier converts cold tap water into warm, soothing mist. View larger . Warm, Soothing Mist for Cold and Cough Relief For those who experience cold and cough symptoms, there are few things more soothing than breathing in moist air, especially during dry winter months or when cold symptoms are at their worst. The Warm Mist Humidifier adds moisture to the air by heating the water to produce steam. The two steam output settings then emit the bacteria-free steam into the room. Medicine Cup Allows for Medicated Vapor Steam Action The Warm Mist Humidifier includes a medicine cup, designed to hold liquid steam medication, which is activated by the rising warm mist. The medication cup is dishwasher safe and removable for easy cleaning. The medicine cup works with any vapor steam medication and increases the soothing benefits of the warm mist. Provides relief from sinus irritation, nasal congestion, dry cough, and cold and flu symptoms. View larger . LED Nightlight and Other User-Friendly Features This compact, easy-to-use humidifier has a removable tank that fits easily in most sinks for quick filling and cleaning. It also features an attractive blue LED dial for operation and adjustments, even when the room is dark. An auto-shut-off feature turns off the humidifier when the tank is empty and a tip-over switch adds additional safety when the unit is accidentally tilted while in operation. Straightforward, Easy Operation Not only are Crane humidifiers stylish, but they are also easy to use and include an auto-shut-off feature that engages when the water tank is empty to ensure safety. The soothing warm mist helps provide for a good night sleep. Operating the Crane Warm Mist Humidifier requires only a few easy steps. Simply remove the water tank from the unit, unscrew the tank cap, and fill the water tank under a water faucet. Securely replace the tank cap, making sure the rubber cap seal is in place, and place the water tank back onto the unit. Place the humidifier away from wooden furniture and set it to desired output setting for comfortable room humidification. Important Tips If you have a lot of minerals in your tap water, it is recommended to use distilled water or filtered water to prevent mineral built up. Cleaning and Storage Frequently cleaning your humidifier is very important. Crane recommends emptying the water in the basin daily, making sure you pour away from the heating element. Disinfect the water basin and tank weekly by using a white vinegar and fresh water solution, let sit for 30 minutes, then rinse. For convenience, the Crane Descaler solution HS-1933 is also available. It is important to disinfect and dry completely before storage. What's in the Box Crane Warm Mist Humidifier and operation manual/warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WRViceI1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crane","source_asin":"B0026IC2BO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0026IC2BO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0026IC2BO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":473445,"name":"Personalized Christmas Stockings Velvet Red Body/White Cuff Ribbon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZL6B5gNaL._AC_.jpg","description":"This popular velvet Christmas Stocking is a nice 18\" size stoking, not too small, not too large. It is made out of white and deep red velvet and it has a nice red ribbon and gold snowflake applique.   Measured along the diagonal from the top left hand corner to the toe, the stocking measures 18 inches, and the width along the cuff is 8 inches. The inside of the stocking is fully lined.   We usually have complimentary designs, be sure to check out our STOCKING FACTORY AMAZON store where you will find over 100 other personalized stocking designs. IMPORTANT: ****** IMPORTANT ********* TO GET YOUR Stockings PERSONALIZED: Configure personalization on the Customize Now Button & ADD TO CART button will be on top of the Customize Now Pop Up Screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZL6B5gNaL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHRISTMAS-STOCKINGS-by-STOCKINGFACTORY","source_asin":"B018KHT8BQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018KHT8BQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018KHT8BQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
