window.products.push({"id":473540,"name":"LHRIVER Electric Fireplace, 25” Freestanding Stove Heater with Remote, Space Heater w/ 3D Flame Effects, Fireplace Heaters for Indoor Use","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fNfQFAC9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Superb Exterior Craftsmanship】 The Medieval cathedral style design and glass arch, which inspired by 16th Century Italian Replica, making it a classic electric fireplace stove. The side hollow out arched windows spice up its graceful style, and make this stove a refined artistic decoration. This fireplace heater perfectly highlights the integration of tradition and modern style. 【Full Steel Material & Stable Frame】The whole frame of this classic fireplace is carefully crafted with strong steel, which is sturdy and durable for long term use. Plus 4 thick steel legs to ensure great stability. With excellent hand-craft tech, makes it a high quality and classical freestanding fireplace for your home. 【Authentic Flame Effect】Based on cutting-edge technology, the flame effect of this fire place not only outperforms that of a real flame in terms of aesthetics, but also avoids the dangers that a real flame poses. There is nothing like the atmosphere that the log and bright flame together create, and you can enjoy the visual experience and warmth provided by this heater in your bedroom, study, or hallway. 【2 Heating Mode & 4 Color and 5 Brightness Option】 This electric stove heater has 2 heating modes: 500W and 1500W, allowing it to adapt to different environments and needs. For safety,the heater is equipped with cut-off device for overheat protection. Besides, it comes with 4 flame/ flame bed colors and 5 flame brightness, you can choose them freely. 【Control Panel & Remote Control】The furnace has control panel in the lower right corner for adjusting the heater, flame speed, dimmer, color, 8H timer, etc. It is worth noting that there is an instant use remote control, which for max 20Ft long-distance, allowing you to freely adjust and control it in the room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fNfQFAC9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LHRIVER","source_asin":"B0BM3RPXVD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM3RPXVD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM3RPXVD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":473541,"name":"WUWEOT Metal Knife Block with Cutting Board Rack, Chopper Holder Pot Lit Organizer Knife Storage, Bakeware Drying Rack Kitchen Storage Organizer Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m0MtBSimL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WUWEOT Knife block with cutting board rack is made of durable metal and mongolian scotch pine, coated with white high-temperature painting that will not rust. The cutting board holder has a small footprint and takes up minimal space on your counter top, perfect for small apartments, bars and dorm rooms. This knife holder can hold not only knife and cutting boards, but also scissor, fruit knife, bakeware, pot lid, cookie sheet, platter, dish, pan, tray and more. Practicial drying rack, wonderful home decoration and organizer. Simple modern design and simple white, great for various kitchen countertops and cabinets styles. Premium exquisite design, smooth surface. A pretty counter organizer for your kitchen. Dimention: 5.5\"L X 5.2\"W X 8.5\"H, has 3 knife block, and 2 slots for cutting board or pot lid. You can place a knife with a maximum width of 4.2\" and a cutting board with a maximum thickness of 0.2\" (Kitchenware and knives shown on the pictures are NOT included).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m0MtBSimL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WUWEOT","source_asin":"B093GTMV5Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093GTMV5Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093GTMV5Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":473542,"name":"Stubby Strip Original Neoprene Bottle or Can Holder - Perfect for Beach, Camping, Tailgating, Sporting Events and more (Camouflage)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81raJYzaoML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The StubbyStrip is perfect for boating, camping, fishing, tailgating, BBQ’s, parties, walking around events, poolside, beach tips, picnics, sporting events, car racing… Not to mention perfect to have on your RV adventures! We’re not out to replace your big cooler. Instead, think of your cooler as the mother-ship and StubbyStrip is the Pod that detaches for venturing out. Because the Stubby Strip is made out of Neoprene, you can drop it right in to your cooler so your drinks get colder faster. When you are ready for that ice cold beverage, you don’t have to fish around the ice and freezing water for your drink, just pull out your loaded StubbyStrip and you’re off to the races! You might ask, “how do the bottles not fall out?” It’s simple – when you wrap up the StubbyStrip, the tension pulls the bottles or cans together. Then, when you pick it up, gravity does the rest! The very weight that pulls at the seams is what tightens up each individual slot in the StubbyStrip, keeping a snug fit around each precious beverage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81raJYzaoML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stubby Strip","source_asin":"B018RPPP54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018RPPP54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018RPPP54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":473543,"name":"French Rolling Pin & Pastry Brush by MiiKO | Large Non-Stick Metal Design, Great for Pastry & Fondant - The Perfect Kit for Creative Bakers - 15.8\" x ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jHudo2sIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"THE ONLY ROLLING PIN & PASTRY BRUSH YOU WILL EVER NEED Whether you are a professional baking master or a first time chef, the MiiKO French Rolling Pin and Pastry Brush can give your baking and kitchen meals that extra something you’ve been missing. The classic handle-less French design is a joy to use, providing more precise movement and control over your pastries. The lightweight non-stick roller won’t squash or rip your dough, but will allow you to keep control and produce a more consistent pastry depth.The stainless steel construction provides many benefits. Not only is it aesthetically pleasing, but it is stronger and more durable than alternative materials. In addition, the brushed finish provides a non-stick, easy to clean surface that will always look like new. It also has the advantage of being light weight, easy to grip, and has the unique ability to retain lower temperatures. To keep pastries and doughs cool while you work, simply chill your rolling pin in your fridge or freezer before using.Included is an extra-long pastry brush, perfect for applying glazes and sauces. Constructed from stainless steel and silicone, it will retain its shape and functionality for years to come.It is also the perfect BBQ accessory. With its thick silicone bristles, you can easily you’re your meats with your favourite sauces, and by making use of its long, heat resistant handle, there is no need to get too close to the hot grill. It’s a brilliant summer barbecue accessory.This original stainless steel French style rolling pin and pastry brush are the perfect addition to any baker’s toolbox. --LOVE MiiKO, LOVE YOUR KITCHEN--","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jHudo2sIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MiiKO","source_asin":"B07122QZFH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07122QZFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07122QZFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
