window.products.push({"id":473642,"name":"Chef'sChoice Belgian Waffle Maker (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WDoacfMuL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"For use with homemade or quick-mix batters, this countertop appliance bakes deep-pocket Belgian waffles in less than 90 seconds. Simply poor in the batter, lower the lid, and it takes care of the rest, with no need to flip--both sides cook at the same time for even browning. The waffle maker's Quad baking system makes it possible to select the ideal texture and color for truly customized waffles. The unit's texture select switch offers two baking modes: \"crisp exterior/moist interior\" or \"uniform texture\", while its rotary browning-control knob from light to dark accommodates individual preferences. In addition, the waffle maker's unique \"floating\" hinge helps provide uniform thickness and even baking, and its red \"baking\" light and green \"ready\" light with an audible signal ensure foolproof operation. Transfer the Belgian waffles to a plate and drizzle with maple syrup or sprinkle with fresh berries or any other favorite topping and enjoy. The unit heats up quickly between bake cycles, making it easy to prepare waffles about as fast as they can be eaten. Other details include a high-quality nonstick baking surface for effortless food release, an easy-to-clean overflow channel, a handy drip tray, built-in cord storage, and the option to store the unit in a space-saving, upright position. Recipes come included. With its sleek look and special-edition lid, the waffle maker measures approximately 12 by 12-4/5 by 5-1/5 inches and carries a one-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WDoacfMuL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef’sChoice","source_asin":"B008TNJ31C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008TNJ31C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008TNJ31C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
