window.products.push({"id":473669,"name":"New Life Contour Memory Foam Pillow Bed Pillows Sleeping with Pillowcase Queen Size Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S6QiOtZyL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Memory Foam Pillow for Sleeping ，Pillow and Cover Enjoy Restful, Healing Sleep and Wake Up Feeling Refreshed  The key to feeling better during the day is a great night's sleep. If you want to enjoy a restful night's sleep and wake up without annoying neck, shoulder and back pain, ordinary pillows simply won't do. You must choose a pillow that offers proper support and alignment. Discount foam pillows don't have the right contours to align your neck and spine and - over time - can lead to nerve or disc problems. Expensive down pillows are often too soft to provide enough support. Both will force your head into unnatural angles that don't promote good sleep or overall good health. This memory foam pillow by is different. It has been designed and tested by a chiropractor with over 20 years experience. With it's contoured shape and special density foam, it is extremely comfortable, yet offers correct support exactly where you need it. It keeps your neck and spine aligned for a more comfortable night's sleep. And because it is a high quality foam, it will retain it's special shape for years, unlike shredded memory foam that can lump and warp over time.The Pillow features a breathable material, so you'll enjoy a cool, allergy-free sleep as well. The removable cover is machine washable so you can rest easy. - Fits in Standard Size Pillow Case - Contoured design promotes proper spine alignment during sleep - Medium Thickness with Two Different Size Contours - Allergy-free material eliminates stuffy head and runny eyes - wake up clear and refreshed Order your memory foam pillow from us today and start enjoying better sleep and improved health tomorrow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S6QiOtZyL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"New Life","source_asin":"B07JVF4B2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JVF4B2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JVF4B2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
