window.products.push({"id":473689,"name":"Evaporative Air Cooler, BALKO 3-IN-1 Windowless Portable Air Conditioner, 4 Modes & 3 Speeds Personal Swamp Cooler w/Humidifier, 12H Timer & Remote, 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pjbN5u6wL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"❄【3-IN-1 Windowless Air Conditioner】BALKO 3-IN-1 indoor air conditioner is a versatile device that combines the functions of a fan, air cooler, and humidifier into one compact unit. Unlike traditional no window air conditioner, this device can be used in any room, with or without windows, and can be easily installed without any modifications. Its unique features allow for personal cooling and comfort at an affordable price. ❄【Multiple Modes Satisfy Your Needs】The BALKO personal air conditioner offers 3 wind speeds [high, medium, low] and 3 modes [normal, sleep, natural, cooling] to suit your preferences. The normal mode provides stable airflow, while the natural mode simulates varying wind intensities found in forests. The sleep mode gradually reduces fan speed every 30 minutes until it reaches the minimum speed. Choose from high (22 ft/s), medium (18 ft/s), or low (15 ft/s) speeds. ❄【Remote Control & Top Control Panel】BALKO's air cooler for room offers dual control options. The simple touch panel on top is intuitive and easy to operate. Plus, the 20 ft remote control allows for convenient adjustments from afar. Relax on your couch or bed and enjoy a gentle breeze while reading or watching your favorite show without the need to get up. Perfect for those who appreciate the luxury of convenience. ❄【12H Timer & Ultra-Quiet Operation】Need a peaceful night's sleep? Our portable ac air conditioner delivers a sound-insulated design that blocks water pump noise, keeping it ultra-quiet at 40 dB. Ideal for meditation or sleep. The 12-hour timer allows you to conserve energy and avoid costly electricity bills by automatically turning off the unit after a set period. Rest easy with our energy-saving and peaceful tower air cooler. ❄【Dry Climate Solution】If you live in a dry climate, you know how uncomfortable the hot summer months can be. Traditional AC can make things worse by removing moisture from the air. BALKO portable swamp coolers come in: by evaporating water and adding humidity to the air, create a more comfortable and healthier indoor environment. This makes them particularly effective in dry regions like the Southwestern US. Choose BALKO today! ❄【Dual Watertank Keeps You Cool for 8 Hours】The innovative dual water tank enables water recycling, enhancing the evaporative cooling pad's water absorption and resulting in pristine cool air. With a 1-Gal capacity, the tank can keep you cool for up to 8 hours when combined with the included 4 ice packs. Moreover, you can add water to the tank from either the top or the bottom, making it convenient for the elderly and pregnant women who don't have to bend over to fill it up. ❄【Keep Your Indoor Wind Health】This bladeless air conditioner is designed with easy cleaning in mind, featuring a removable rear grille, tank, and wheels. Safety is a top priority with its fingertip pinch-proof grills, fused plug, and built-in circuit protection, making it an freestanding tower fan you can trust. Keep your space cool and safe with this easy-to-use and easy-to-clean ac fan. ❄【65° Widespread Coverage】Benefitting from the powerful wind of 458 CFM, and 65° wide oscillation to circle the cooling wind throughout the whole room, this air conditioner portable for room can quickly cover your area up to 250Sq.Ft. The portable evaporative cooler comes with 0.42 sq. Ft large louvers to not endanger children and pets. You can manually adjust the louvers in any position. The coolness will blow everywhere! ❄【Easy to Use & Energy-saving】No hose/exhaust assembly no window needed, take this bedroom air conditioner out from the package box and plug it in for cooling down, even senior people could get the hang of it easily. The garage air conditioners working power is only 65W, with no installation cost, and up to 75% less electricity usage to reduce bills, it is very suitable for our low-carbon lifestyle. ❄【Lightweight ＆ Easy to Move for Indoor/Outdoor Use】This lightweight and portable evaporative cooling fan weighs 9 lbs and has 4 gliding casters and a built-in handle for easy movement. Its compact size (22in) allows it to fit into any small area or corner, like under a desk or dining table. Perfect for use in various settings, from bedrooms to dorm rooms to recreational trailers. Keep this ventless portable air conditioner in mind when looking for a small, convenient solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pjbN5u6wL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALKO","source_asin":"B0C6DZFTDY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6DZFTDY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6DZFTDY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
