window.products.push({"id":473792,"name":"Nambé MT0861 Skye Accent Plate, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516JyEfb8UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With contrasting pieces in both wood and bone china, each creation in the Skye collection mirrors the same ridge detail seen through the dinnerware ensemble. Together, these pieces tell a story of Sophisticated simplicity. The Skye dinnerware collection takes inspiration from the rolling Hills and serene Landscape of the Isle of Skye. Casual enough for everyday dining, the Skye dinnerware collection doubles as a formal, sophisticated table setting. Robin levien is one of Europe's most consistently successful and innovative product designers. Over the past 30 years he has designed many best-selling ranges for the home. His studio range for ideal standard revolutionized the UK bathroom market and the trend porcelain has been Europe's most successful contemporary tableware of the past quarter century. Recognized for its award-winning designs for more than 60 years, Nambe's commitment to timeless beauty, artistic integrity and uncompromising quality is evident in the brand's collection of serve ware, barware, home decor and gift items. Nambe collaborates with the world's most esteemed designers to develop products that bring function and style into the home. Package contains (1) Nambe Skye accent plate. Made of bone china. Measurements: 9. 75\" D x 0. 75\" H. Care instructions: dishwasher safe; microwave safe. Designed by Robin levien in 2015 for the Skye collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516JyEfb8UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nambe","source_asin":"B074V628X7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074V628X7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074V628X7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
