window.products.push({"id":473795,"name":"HAPTIME Cloud Key Holder, Magnetic Key Holder for Wall, Cute Decorative Way to Hold Your Keys, Easy to Install, Great for Entryway, Foyer, Garage Door","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uaqNw-hvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Cute Decorative Cloud】-- The Key Holder is adorable, Perfect for mounting in hallways, kitchen, bedroom, dorm rooms and etc. 【Magnetic Key Holder, No Hooks】-- Strong magnets keep keys in place, so it's incredibly simple to use. The key holder is definitely convenient for putting up keys at the door. 【Easy to Install】 -- No need to use screws or hardware to mount it, Simply peel off sticker and stick it to smooth wooden, ceramic, plastic, flat metal surface to have better bearing capacity. 【Safety and Non-toxic】-- Made of High Quality ABS Plastic and Strong Magnet. 【Specification】-- Size:10*3*5.5 cm / Weight:80g (Note: Some keys, key rings are made of zinc,zinc alloy or Non-magnetic material, they will not be hold by the magnet key holder)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uaqNw-hvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAPTIME","source_asin":"B01CPK0QTM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CPK0QTM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CPK0QTM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":473796,"name":"Professional Citrus Juicer - Manual Citrus Press and Orange Squeezer - Metal Lemon Squeezer - Premium Quality Heavy Duty Manual Orange Juicer and Lime","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QDys7GmPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXTRACTS UNTIL THE LAST DROP: The search for the perfect Kitchen Tools and Gadgets stops here! Our Citrus Press is proven to Squeeze all the Juice out, seedless and pulp-free. Get the Maximum Extraction from Oranges, Lemons, Limes, Grapefruits, and other Citrus Fruits. Enjoy organic, sugar-free, and freshly squeezed Citrus Juice drinks with little effort as it comes with a very comfortable Juicer Hand grip handle. MAKES LIFE EASIER: Our Citrus Squeezer makes juicing easy-peasy lemon-squeezy. Helps you to save time and effort by squeezing Lemon Juice, Lime Juice, and Orange Juice in just seconds. No need to worry about electricity and batteries. Perfect for Home and Professional Juicing Needs — Hummus, Guacamole, Lemonade, Margarita and other Cocktail drinks. MORE FRUITS TO ENJOY THAN YOUR HANHELD JUICER: The 5 inch diameter allows it to be used with various types and sizes of fruit. It can even handle the largest of grapefruits. Easier to use than hand held juicers known as mexican elbows. You and your family will love the Healthy and Nutritious Juices you can get from Apples, Pineapple, Meyer Lemons, Key Limes, Limequats, Mexican Limes, Eureka or Lisbon Lemons, Rangpur or Tahiti Citrus Limes, from Florida, California or abroad. EASY TO CLEAN AND SAFE: Focus more on Juicing than cleaning up. All detachable parts are Easy to Clean and Dishwasher Friendly. The filter cone and custom-made cup are made of Food-Grade 304 Stainless Steel that is Safe and Healthy. HIGH-QUALITY MATERIALS: This Multipurpose Lemon Squeezer and Lime Squeezer is made of heavy-duty, durable cast iron with sturdy construction that is built to last. The Leverage Mechanism ensures a One-time Easy Pull. Our Citrus Press is tested to withstand pressure from continuous pressing. The Heavy Rubberized Base secures worry-free squeezing. It firmly keeps the Citrus Juicer in place, with no falling, tipping, or sliding. Even when using as a pomegranate press juicer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QDys7GmPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"aswei","source_asin":"B0B7JL79W8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-473796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7JL79W8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7JL79W8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
